<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFF8E7">
  <title>FlowerShop | ช่อดอกไม้ที่ออกแบบเองตามใจคุณ</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --cream: #FFF8E7;
      --cream-light: #FFFAEB;
      --pink-pale: #F7DAD9;
      --pink: #FCC0C5;
      --pink-bottom: #FFD0CD;
      --yellow: #FBF2C0;
      --yellow-deep: #FEEDAA;
      --olive: #8A8651;
      --brown: #6F4E37;
      --copy: rgba(111, 78, 55, .85);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { min-height: 100%; }
    body {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      min-height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100svh;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif;
    }
    .scene { position: fixed; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
    .blob, .backdrop, .flower, .dot { position: absolute; }
    .blob { border-radius: 50%; }
    .blob-top-left { width: 520px; height: 520px; left: -120px; top: -200px; background: var(--pink-pale); }
    .blob-bottom-right { width: 660px; height: 660px; left: calc(100% - 470px); top: 530px; background: var(--pink-bottom); }
    .blob-top-right { width: 300px; height: 300px; left: calc(100% - 350px); top: -90px; background: var(--yellow); }
    .blob-bottom-left { width: 380px; height: 380px; left: -70px; top: 690px; background: var(--yellow-deep); }
    .backdrop {
      width: min(760px, 82vw, 82vh);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      left: 50%;
      top: 50%;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--cream-light);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .flower-bottom-right { width: 287px; right: 124px; bottom: 22px; --petal: var(--pink-pale); --flower-center: var(--brown); }
    .dot { width: 18px; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--olive); }
    .dot-one { left: 37.8%; top: 18.7%; }
    .dot-two { left: 74.5%; bottom: 9.3%; width: 24px; }
    .dot-three { left: 5.8%; top: 48.1%; width: 14px; }
    .dot-four { right: 5.9%; top: 51.3%; width: 16px; }
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      width: min(727px, calc(100% - 40px));
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 48px;
      text-align: center;
      transform: translateY(-20px);
    }
    .hero-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 22px; }
    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--brown);
      font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
      font-size: clamp(64px, 9.45vw, 136px);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .tagline {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--copy);
      font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .order-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 70px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 34px 18px 44px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--brown);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(111, 78, 55, .28);
      color: var(--cream-light);
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .2s ease;
    }
    .order-link:hover { background: #5f422e; box-shadow: 0 13px 32px rgba(111, 78, 55, .34); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .order-link:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--olive); outline-offset: 5px; }
    .arrow { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex: none; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .blob-top-left { width: 340px; height: 340px; left: -180px; top: -150px; }
      .blob-bottom-right { width: 420px; height: 420px; left: calc(100% - 260px); top: calc(100% - 270px); }
      .blob-top-right { width: 190px; height: 190px; left: calc(100% - 210px); top: -80px; }
      .blob-bottom-left { width: 260px; height: 260px; left: -150px; top: calc(100% - 140px); }
      .flower-top-left { width: 150px; left: -22px; top: 28px; }
      .flower-bottom-left { width: 118px; left: 16px; bottom: 38px; }
      .flower-top-right { width: 132px; right: 9px; top: 32px; }
      .flower-bottom-right { width: 178px; right: 4px; bottom: 10px; }
      .hero { gap: 38px; transform: translateY(-8px); }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(48px, 12.5vw, 82px); }
      .hero-copy { gap: 16px; }
      .tagline { font-size: 16px; }
      .order-link { min-height: 60px; padding: 14px 28px 14px 34px; font-size: 18px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      h1 { font-size: 45px; }
      .tagline { font-size: 14px; }
      .hero { width: calc(100% - 24px); }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="scene" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="blob blob-top-left"></div>
    <div class="blob blob-bottom-right"></div>
    <div class="blob blob-top-right"></div>
    <div class="blob blob-bottom-left"></div>
    <div class="backdrop"></div>
    <div class="flower flower-top-left"></div>
    <div class="flower flower-bottom-left"></div>
    <div class="flower flower-top-right"></div>
    <div class="flower flower-bottom-right"></div>
    <span class="dot dot-one"></span>
    <span class="dot dot-two"></span>
    <span class="dot dot-three"></span>
    <span class="dot dot-four"></span>
  </div>
  <main class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>FlowerShop</h1>
      <p class="tagline">ช่อดอกไม้ที่ออกแบบเองตามใจคุณ<br>มอบความรู้สึกดี ๆ ในทุกโอกาสสำคัญ</p>
    </div>
    <a class="order-link" href="/shop">
      <span>สั่งทำช่อดอกไม้</span>
      <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M4.5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
    </a>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
